    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4600" root="ثل" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِلَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>Death;</i> or <i>a state of perdition</i> or <i>destruction;</i> (K;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَلَلٌ</span></b> ; (S, M, K;) which
latter is also an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَلَّ</span> signifying “ he
killed, ” or “ destroyed: ” (As, S, K:) pl. of the
former <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِلَلٌ</span>. (K.)

